WEBVTT

00:01:29.746 --> 00:01:35.996
So these are the people who can present
not optimism, but a case for optimism.

00:01:36.079 --> 00:01:38.538
They're the people I'm talking
to this season.

00:01:38.746 --> 00:01:42.413
So let's see if they can persuade us now.

00:01:42.413 --> 00:01:47.079
Then the place I want to start is with
A.I. artificial intelligence.

00:01:47.746 --> 00:01:51.371
This, of course, is the next innovative
technology that is going to change

00:01:51.371 --> 00:01:54.829
everything as we know it,
for better or for worse.

00:01:55.496 --> 00:01:59.454
Today was painted not with the
usual dystopian brush,

00:01:59.746 --> 00:02:02.246
but by someone who truly believes
in its potential.